{% schema %}
  {
    "presets": [{ "name": "sporton-faqs" }],
    "name": "sporton-faqs",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-602852479155045298 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/sporton-active/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=THEME_SECTION&editorId=602852479155045298)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"off_lazy_script"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"gg48Z5psBRB_text","label":"gg48Z5psBRB_text","default":"FAQs"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1SJCz10Ou_childItem_0","label":"gg1SJCz10Ou_childItem_0","default":"<p>What makes Sporton activewear different from other brands?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg1SJCz10Ou_childItem_1","label":"gg1SJCz10Ou_childItem_1","default":"<p>How can I find the right size for me?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnMu1C_QXS_text","label":"ggnMu1C_QXS_text","default":"<p>At Sporton, we spent over two years researching, testing, and perfecting our fabrics to deliver unmatched comfort, performance, and durability. Our products are designed to support you at every stage of your fitness journey—no matter your goal, body type, or activity level.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggcFCEbWrDt_text","label":"ggcFCEbWrDt_text","default":"<p>Every Sporton product page includes a detailed size chart and helpful fit notes. We also show the height and size of our models, so you can get a clearer visual idea of how each item fits on different body types. If you’re between sizes, we suggest sizing up for a roomier fit, or you can always reach out to our customer support for personalized sizing advice.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8u6UFRdg8_childItem_0","label":"gg8u6UFRdg8_childItem_0","default":"<p>Where do you ship, and how long does delivery take?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg8u6UFRdg8_childItem_1","label":"gg8u6UFRdg8_childItem_1","default":"<p>What is your return and exchange policy?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggykZp3qqwF_text","label":"ggykZp3qqwF_text","default":"<p>We currently ship nationwide and across Europe, with plans to expand even further!</p><ul><li><strong>Germany:</strong> Orders are delivered next day, and for customers in Berlin/Sporton's close friends, same day delivery may be available. (orders before 1pm)</li><li><strong>Other European Countries:</strong> Delivery typically takes 2–3 business days.</li><li><strong>International Orders:</strong> Shipping takes around 7 business days, depending on location.<br>Standard and express options are available at checkout, and you’ll receive a tracking link as soon as your order ships.</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggzHGApmpcf_text","label":"ggzHGApmpcf_text","default":"<p>We accept returns and exchanges within 30 days of delivery as long as items are unworn and with original tags attached. To initiate a return or exchange, simply visit our [Returns Portal] or contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@sporton.com\" target=\"_blank\">support@sporton.</a>store</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguWVpth1AF_childItem_0","label":"gguWVpth1AF_childItem_0","default":"<p>Is Sporton quality really that special?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gguWVpth1AF_childItem_1","label":"gguWVpth1AF_childItem_1","default":"<p>Are your fabrics and materials sustainable?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSCho9ygMj_text","label":"ggSCho9ygMj_text","default":"<p>Absolutely! We spent over two years sourcing and pressure-testing dozens of fabric blends and trims. We’re so confident in our quality that we offer a satisfaction guarantee: if you’re not impressed, let us know and we’ll make it right.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg9aiWnsHl8_text","label":"gg9aiWnsHl8_text","default":"<p>Sustainability is a priority at Sporton. Our collection features eco-friendly fabrics selected for performance and minimal impact, and we continuously seek ways to increase our use of recycled and responsible materials.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEfdcB0Zi-_childItem_0","label":"ggEfdcB0Zi-_childItem_0","default":"<p>How can I join the affiliate program and sporton community?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEfdcB0Zi-_childItem_1","label":"ggEfdcB0Zi-_childItem_1","default":"<p>When is the next fitness event?</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5QNAHFh7P_text","label":"gg5QNAHFh7P_text","default":"<p>Joining our affiliate program is easy—and we’d love to have you! Simply visit our [Affiliate Program page] and fill out the quick application form. Once accepted, you’ll get your unique referral link, early access to launches, and special perks for sharing Sporton with your audience.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEnbKPONwB_text","label":"ggEnbKPONwB_text","default":"<p>Stay in the loop by signing up for our newsletter! You’ll be the first to get invited to our upcoming fitness events, as well as enjoy first looks at new collections and exclusive sneak peeks, just for members of our community. Don’t miss out—subscribe today!</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
